[00:12.18]Button your lip dont let the shield slip
[00:12.18]闭上你的嘴不要口无遮拦
[00:20.82]Take a fresh grip on your bullet proof mask
[00:20.82]握好你的防弹面具
[00:29.19]And if they try to break down your disguise with their questions
[00:29.19]如果他们用他们的方式去揭开你的伪装
[00:40.60]You can hide hide hide
[00:40.60]你可以藏起来
[00:53.79]Behind paranoid eyes
[00:53.79]躲开那些妄想的人
[01:04.91]You put on your brave face and slip over the road for a jar
[01:04.91]你戴上你勇敢的面具 漫不经心地走过这条路
[01:14.54]Fixing your grin as you casually lean on the bar
[01:14.54]咧着嘴就如往常一样靠在吧台
[01:23.73]Laughing too loud at the rest of the world
[01:23.73]笑得太大声，把整个世界都抛诸脑后
[01:28.85]With the boys in the crowd
[01:28.85]男孩子们在人群中
[01:35.48]You hide hide hide
[01:35.48]你躲藏着
[01:40.42]Behind petrified eyes
[01:40.42]在那惊恐的眼睛后面
[02:27.87]You believed in their stories of fame fortune and glory
[02:27.87]你相信他们那些关于名誉和荣耀的故事
[02:37.18]Now youre lost in a haze of alchohol soft middle age
[02:37.18]现在你迷失在酒精中
[02:47.00]The pie in the sky turned out to be miles too high
[02:47.00]一切都那么渺茫
[02:58.31]And you hide hide hide
[02:58.31]你躲藏着
[03:20.68]Behind brown and mild eyes
